++
++2026-08-06 10:13: a micro-batch arrived with input_ids of shape
++[1, 9142729177965406720] -- a sequence length just under 2^63, i.e. garbage
++deserialized as tensor metadata. torch raised "Storage size calculation
++overflowed", rank 0 died, the remaining ranks hung until the NCCL collective
++timeout, and the run sat dead for six hours.
++
++Sequences pack to at most seq_len*cp, so anything past a generous multiple of
++that is corruption. Validate on receipt and skip the batch. Costs one batch
++instead of the run.
++
++Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
