++At max_inflight_rollouts=1024 the tunnel layer saturated: all 24 tunnels
++wedged at once, and once the watchdog was fixed it settled into an
++equilibrium rebuilding 10-14 per 45s cycle while they re-wedged just as fast.
++Engines fell to 1-6 concurrent because the churn killed in-flight requests.
